OL,3,A'He will be forever 21': Tribute to
OL,4,Aformer UK school pupil killed in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeter Kormylo, archivist at the
OL,8,FUkrainian Prisoner of War chapel in
OL,9,FLockerbie where Petrov attended
OL,10,Fservices, said the whole community was
OL,11,Fupset by the death of a young man who
OL,12,Fwould be "forever 21".
